## How to resolve

Keep both intentions wherever they are compatible. These changes come from two agents that could not see each other's work, so a conflict is usually two correct edits to the same region rather than a disagreement.

Say `unresolvable` only when the two sides genuinely cannot both hold — when keeping one necessarily breaks the other. Do not say it merely because the merge is awkward.

